WEBVTT

00:00:07.470 --> 00:00:10.140
Our Tauron victory was overwhelming!

00:00:10.220 --> 00:00:12.980
The wind is definitely with us!

00:00:13.060 --> 00:00:16.270
So we're going to take advantage
of our momentum and head

00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:21.150
to the star system Alta, which includes
the Tribe of Silver's mother planet Codomos!

00:00:21.230 --> 00:00:25.860
Each fleet will advance upon all the
terminal planets in the entire area.

00:00:25.950 --> 00:00:29.240
Seize every last one of them!

00:00:29.330 --> 00:00:32.580
I can't believe how they're being
wild with joy over that victory...

00:00:32.660 --> 00:00:34.620
It must be nice to be that downright foolish...

00:00:35.040 --> 00:00:41.750
<b>Over and over again I wish on the dazzling star far away</b>

00:00:41.840 --> 00:00:47.970
<b>Wandering heartbeats, gravitation, the story of their attraction</b>

00:01:01.440 --> 00:01:08.160
<b>When did it begin? No one knows the end of it</b>

00:01:08.240 --> 00:01:15.160
<b>It's not a trick or an illusion, it's a current that I can't swim against</b>

00:01:15.250 --> 00:01:17.160
<b>(Dark!)</b>

00:01:17.250 --> 00:01:22.170
<b>The monster that lives in the darkness</b>

00:01:22.250 --> 00:01:24.000
<b>(Blight!)</b>

00:01:24.090 --> 00:01:27.630
<b>As if I were easily getting swallowed into it</b>

00:01:27.720 --> 00:01:29.260
<b>(I seek a hero!)</b>

00:01:29.340 --> 00:01:31.890
<b>I awake as I truly am</b>

00:01:31.970 --> 00:01:40.730
<b>If God says conflicts and life's old dreams go hand in hand</b>

00:01:40.810 --> 00:01:45.940
<b>I'm looking for you even if it means ripping my body apart</b>

00:01:46.030 --> 00:01:49.320
<b>With a flower held to my heart,</b>

00:01:49.410 --> 00:01:54.580
<b>no one can stop this heartbeat now that it's begun</b>

00:01:54.660 --> 00:01:58.660
<b>We're destined to come in contact</b>

00:02:06.670 --> 00:02:11.680
Under a unanimous conclusion of the Council
as well as the Federation fleet headquarters,

00:02:11.760 --> 00:02:14.890
I hereby issue an honorable
mission to the Argonaut!

00:02:14.970 --> 00:02:17.430
In order to ensure our victory,

00:02:17.520 --> 00:02:19.850
leave the starway along with the Nodos

00:02:19.940 --> 00:02:24.610
and close in on
Planet Codomos from behind.

00:02:24.690 --> 00:02:27.820
It's not a difficult task for you, is it?

00:02:27.900 --> 00:02:30.740
Good luck to you.

00:02:30.820 --> 00:02:34.780
What a coward! How dare he use
the Argonaut's achievements against us

00:02:34.870 --> 00:02:36.660
and give us such a reckless order?!

00:02:36.740 --> 00:02:40.080
That goes to show how much he's afraid of us.

00:02:40.170 --> 00:02:44.630
He's afraid that all the fleets might band
together around this ship and the princess.

00:02:44.710 --> 00:02:48.920
There's no need for us to accept that mission.
This is just him trying to get payback.

00:02:49.010 --> 00:02:51.010
What would you like to do?

00:02:51.090 --> 00:02:52.680
Let's accept it.

00:02:54.720 --> 00:03:00.770
If we accept this task, we should be
able to reduce casualties on both sides.

00:03:00.850 --> 00:03:03.560
In that way we probably
won't have to become the victims

00:03:03.650 --> 00:03:06.230
of those royals' reckless rush, either.

00:03:06.320 --> 00:03:08.230
Good point.

00:03:08.320 --> 00:03:13.530
Age, we'll have to ask you
to fight another difficult battle.

00:03:13.620 --> 00:03:17.580
That's okay! Age has Iolaous!

00:03:17.660 --> 00:03:20.830
I might be weak, but I'll do
whatever I can to back you up.

00:03:20.910 --> 00:03:21.580
We'll work together and

00:03:21.620 --> 00:03:24.460
If Age gets lost you bring him back!

00:03:24.540 --> 00:03:26.540
Am I your guardian or what?

00:03:29.170 --> 00:03:30.510
What about Mehitak?

00:03:33.090 --> 00:03:35.800
Will it be all right if I stay on this ship?

00:03:38.390 --> 00:03:40.930
If possible I'd rather not fight.

00:03:41.020 --> 00:03:47.190
And I don't know anything about the
Tribe of Silver that could help you, but...

00:03:47.270 --> 00:03:52.070
...if you guys lose,
my tribe may be destroyed, too...

00:03:52.150 --> 00:03:53.450
So...

00:03:54.780 --> 00:04:00.540
Under my authority, we will
do what the Pore's hero wants.

00:04:03.210 --> 00:04:04.500
Thank you.

00:04:06.210 --> 00:04:09.800
Well then, let's get ready
for departure immediately.

00:04:09.880 --> 00:04:12.420
This is something only
this ship can make happen.

00:04:12.510 --> 00:04:16.680
Let's show off our abilities to the
Council and the fleet headquarters!

00:04:25.940 --> 00:04:29.610
We will soon enter the enemy's living room.

00:04:29.690 --> 00:04:32.730
This is the last time we'll be able to
communicate with each other in real time.

00:04:32.820 --> 00:04:37.200
You and your crew are the same as usual, huh?

00:04:37.280 --> 00:04:39.620
It's no surprise that we
drew the short straw as usual.

00:04:39.700 --> 00:04:44.710
Even if we have to leave the starway,
knowing that we're under the command

00:04:44.790 --> 00:04:48.880
of our princess is much more encouraging
than being under the command of those fools.

00:04:48.960 --> 00:04:50.630
We also believe that one day

00:04:50.710 --> 00:04:55.130
we'll be able to serve under
Princess Dhianeila once again.

00:04:55.220 --> 00:04:58.180
We will definitely reorganize
the fleet when the time is right.

00:04:58.260 --> 00:05:01.850
So don't let your guard down.
You've come this far with no real problem.

00:05:01.930 --> 00:05:03.520
Something is not right.

00:05:03.600 --> 00:05:07.140
But either way, we have
no choice but to go forward.

00:05:08.690 --> 00:05:10.650
I wish you good luck in battle.

00:05:13.030 --> 00:05:14.650
Checking up on your guys?

00:05:15.700 --> 00:05:18.610
Everyone is recovering fast.
I thank you for that, Aneasha.

00:05:18.700 --> 00:05:24.200
None of them were injured that terribly.
Besides, it wasn't just my healing power.

00:05:24.290 --> 00:05:29.120
In future battles, that power
of yours will be indispensable.

00:05:29.210 --> 00:05:33.500
But I still don't want you to do
anything reckless just because I'm here.

00:05:33.590 --> 00:05:38.090
There are times when my
power isn't enough, you know.

00:05:40.220 --> 00:05:43.350
You still haven't forgotten
about the promise, have you?

00:05:44.520 --> 00:05:46.640
A knight's word is his bond.

00:05:46.730 --> 00:05:48.310
I'll take your word for it.

00:05:57.990 --> 00:06:01.620
Do you know what's going
to happen to my tribe, Age?

00:06:01.700 --> 00:06:03.780
Nope.

00:06:03.870 --> 00:06:05.200
I see.

00:06:05.290 --> 00:06:07.540
But Dad and the others said that

00:06:07.620 --> 00:06:11.790
we wouldn't be able to go to
the future unless we find it together.

00:06:11.880 --> 00:06:16.840
You, too, Mehitak.
Your father and mother, too.

00:06:16.920 --> 00:06:18.510
Everyone together.

00:06:22.550 --> 00:06:26.930
Acquisition of Codomos,
the mother planet of the Tribe of Silver.

00:06:27.020 --> 00:06:31.650
Another of the twelve
agreements is about to be realized.

00:06:31.730 --> 00:06:37.570
What real intention did the Tribe of Gold
try to get across through the agreements?

00:06:37.650 --> 00:06:44.120
And a war this scale has begun before we've
even learned much about the Tribe of Silver,

00:06:44.200 --> 00:06:47.740
which also has agreements with the Nodos.

00:06:47.830 --> 00:06:52.120
I want to know the future that you believe in.

00:06:52.210 --> 00:06:53.420
Age...

00:07:00.130 --> 00:07:28.830
Why?

00:07:28.910 --> 00:07:32.830
Why did they stop guiding us?

00:07:39.880 --> 00:07:44.630
Rom Ror's emotions
were placed in me just now.

00:07:44.720 --> 00:07:50.520
He failed to acquire the fifth Nodos
and lost the path to the planet Olone...

00:07:50.600 --> 00:07:57.020
And the last of the Tribe of Gold
vanished before his eyes.

00:07:57.110 --> 00:08:00.030
He refuses to face it also.

00:08:00.110 --> 00:08:03.450
Refuses to face what, Prome-sama?

00:08:03.530 --> 00:08:05.820
Worries and fear that are coming from

00:08:05.910 --> 00:08:11.620
the fact that he must take the place
of the Tribe of Gold now that they're gone.

00:08:11.700 --> 00:08:13.460
He refuses to face the fact

00:08:13.540 --> 00:08:18.000
that this is the very source of
the will to destroy the Tribe of Iron.

00:08:18.090 --> 00:08:22.550
So will the Tribe of Iron
target this planet after all?

00:08:22.630 --> 00:08:24.260
Probably.

00:08:24.340 --> 00:08:28.640
Because it is the birth planet of our tribe,

00:08:28.720 --> 00:08:35.140
Rom Ror will send Yuty off, and might
try to destroy them along with the planet.

00:08:35.230 --> 00:08:36.900
You mean this planet Codomos?

00:08:36.980 --> 00:08:41.360
We don't find significance
in the birth planet of a tribe.

00:08:41.440 --> 00:08:44.690
Unlike the Tribe of Iron...

00:08:44.780 --> 00:08:48.370
...or the Tribe of Gold...

00:08:49.830 --> 00:08:53.120
The thought that the ones who can
acquire the power of the Tribe of Gold

00:08:53.200 --> 00:08:59.170
may be the Tribe of Iron after all
is getting bigger and bigger inside of me.

00:08:59.250 --> 00:09:01.800
However, the agreement that I'm in stipulates

00:09:01.880 --> 00:09:05.630
that the Tribe of Silver
will be the one to acquire it.

00:09:05.720 --> 00:09:11.640
"Item: Your tribe shall prosper as
long as you obey the Tribe of Silver."

00:09:11.720 --> 00:09:18.310
"Item: You must fight as the Nodos against
those who oppose the Tribe of Silver."

00:09:18.400 --> 00:09:25.440
"Item: When the Tribe of Silver's Nodos
faces grave danger, you must save her."

00:09:25.530 --> 00:09:32.450
"Item: You must tell the Tribe of Silver
when you discover the Tribe of Gold's power."

00:09:32.540 --> 00:09:40.000
"Item: you must protect the Tribe of Gold's
power when it might be lost."

00:09:40.080 --> 00:09:47.050
Under the tribe's will, I determined those
five agreements that have been given to you.

00:09:47.130 --> 00:09:49.590
It doesn't mean that they signify the future.

00:09:49.680 --> 00:09:54.470
However, it was the Tribe of Gold who
determined the number of the agreements.

00:09:54.560 --> 00:09:59.940
Maybe they knew the future...
your will, Prome-sama.

00:10:00.020 --> 00:10:03.610
If that's the case, they must have known
the will of the Tribe of Iron as well.

00:10:03.690 --> 00:10:07.570
If they also included the
acquisition of the Tribe of Gold's power

00:10:07.650 --> 00:10:11.240
in that Nodos' agreement...

00:10:11.320 --> 00:10:14.240
Would that even be possible?

00:10:14.330 --> 00:10:18.250
One of the agreements determined
by Rom Ror for Karkinos also stipulates

00:10:18.330 --> 00:10:22.580
that he shall be released from
his toils when the Tribe of Silver

00:10:22.670 --> 00:10:27.090
acquires the Tribe of Gold's power.

00:10:27.170 --> 00:10:32.050
And one of the agreements that he
determined for Yuty also stipulates

00:10:32.140 --> 00:10:37.350
that if someone other than the Tribe
of Silver acquires the Tribe of Gold's power,

00:10:37.430 --> 00:10:42.400
she must destroy it,
even at the cost of her own life.

00:10:44.070 --> 00:10:49.900
I wonder why the Tribe of Gold
left open the possibility that

00:10:49.990 --> 00:10:52.860
we might be given agreements
that are inconsistent.

00:10:52.950 --> 00:10:58.750
We don't even know if all the
agreements will be realized or not.

00:10:58.830 --> 00:11:01.960
Lecty... The child of time.

00:11:02.040 --> 00:11:04.460
I'm praying that the war against
the Tribe of Iron will clarify

00:11:04.540 --> 00:11:09.170
the true intention of the agreements for you.

00:11:09.260 --> 00:11:11.630
Yes, Prome-sama.

00:11:15.930 --> 00:11:20.100
Go now. If you get any further
separated from Rom Ror and the others

00:11:20.180 --> 00:11:22.810
you won't be able to reach them in one jump.

00:11:22.900 --> 00:11:24.440
Yes.

00:11:27.650 --> 00:11:31.610
Why don't you spit it out?
So is Mehitak really

00:11:31.700 --> 00:11:33.240
Oh, you're here.

00:11:33.320 --> 00:11:37.700
I was just asking Karkinos a question.
Did Mehitak really die?

00:11:37.790 --> 00:11:42.910
Whether he's alive or not, he was still
defeated with no strength left in him.

00:11:43.000 --> 00:11:45.920
The agreement dictates his release.

00:11:46.000 --> 00:11:49.750
The final agreement to
protect my life still remains.

00:11:49.840 --> 00:11:54.090
If Mehitak tries to escape from
that agreement while he's still alive,

00:11:54.180 --> 00:11:57.100
we will destroy his tribe.

00:11:57.180 --> 00:12:03.100
"You must fight those who oppose
the Tribe of Silver with your life."

00:12:03.190 --> 00:12:07.900
That's one of Karkinos' agreements.
Do you wish to see that come true as well?

00:12:07.980 --> 00:12:13.240
The Nodos' agreements are for the
Tribe of Silver to govern this universe.

00:12:13.320 --> 00:12:15.490
There's only one thing that needs to come true,

00:12:15.570 --> 00:12:19.910
and that is for the Tribe of Silver to
become a great presence which rivals theirs.

00:12:19.990 --> 00:12:22.950
That's how I understand it as well.

00:12:23.040 --> 00:12:26.170
My agreements also include your protection.

00:12:26.250 --> 00:12:30.550
Even if there's no Mehitak around,
I'll be sure to fulfill that.

00:12:30.630 --> 00:12:32.630
That doesn't give me any comfort.

00:12:32.720 --> 00:12:37.930
I'm the one who has to fight after all.
There's no need for you to fight.

00:12:52.990 --> 00:12:58.200
"The Federation fleet is currently
charging forward in full career in order to

00:12:58.280 --> 00:13:00.240
seize all the terminal
planets in the star system.

00:13:00.330 --> 00:13:02.580
They have been steadily producing
extremely positive war results."

00:13:02.660 --> 00:13:04.250
That's the full message...

00:13:04.330 --> 00:13:06.120
It's going too smoothly...

00:13:06.210 --> 00:13:08.920
The surveillance unit is now ready to go.

00:13:09.000 --> 00:13:11.290
You never know where
the enemy might show up.

00:13:11.380 --> 00:13:12.880
Stay alert.

00:13:43.450 --> 00:13:44.700
Descending.

00:13:47.210 --> 00:13:48.290
I can't sense it.

00:13:48.370 --> 00:13:49.580
What?

00:13:49.670 --> 00:13:52.880
I don't sense the presence
of the Tribe of Silver.

00:13:52.960 --> 00:13:56.050
There's no sign of hostility.
No indications of the enemy, either.

00:13:56.130 --> 00:13:58.260
The princess isn't
feeling their presence, either,

00:13:58.340 --> 00:14:01.430
but there's a possibility that this is a trap.

00:14:01.510 --> 00:14:02.600
Don't let your guard down.

00:14:02.680 --> 00:14:03.850
I know.

00:14:13.940 --> 00:14:15.570
Food storage?

00:14:17.240 --> 00:14:18.650
Biological response?

00:14:18.740 --> 00:14:20.410
Hold it!

00:14:22.580 --> 00:14:24.410
It's empty, you said?

00:14:24.490 --> 00:14:27.120
They're all gone except
the tribes from this planet.

00:14:27.200 --> 00:14:32.670
There's no sign of weapons or defenses.
All there's left is just food and medicine...

00:14:32.750 --> 00:14:36.960
They probably left them here out of charity.

00:14:37.050 --> 00:14:41.970
No defense unit even at the terminal planet...

00:14:44.560 --> 00:14:46.060
What's the meaning of that?

00:14:46.140 --> 00:14:48.730
Where's their main force?

00:14:48.810 --> 00:14:51.600
I know they've had plenty of
time to strengthen their defenses,

00:14:51.690 --> 00:14:53.480
but on the other hand they didn't have time

00:14:53.560 --> 00:14:56.270
for major relocation
to abandon this star system.

00:14:56.360 --> 00:14:58.610
Send the signal for fleet
reorganization to Nilval.

00:14:58.690 --> 00:14:59.610
Father?

00:14:59.700 --> 00:15:02.700
Why? We don't know if
this is an emergency just yet.

00:15:02.780 --> 00:15:05.240
This is indeed a critical situation.

00:15:05.330 --> 00:15:10.250
We have challenged them without
knowing anything about their civilization.

00:15:10.330 --> 00:15:11.870
Their civilization?

00:15:11.960 --> 00:15:16.500
What if they have no
concept of "our own place"?

00:15:16.590 --> 00:15:19.420
Individuals would spread
out without limitations

00:15:19.510 --> 00:15:22.260
and rarely run into others of their own tribe.

00:15:22.340 --> 00:15:24.340
That would be their lifestyle.

00:15:24.430 --> 00:15:27.180
If that were the case, wouldn't it be impossible

00:15:27.260 --> 00:15:30.560
to confirm the will of the entire tribe
or ensure survival of their offspring?

00:15:30.640 --> 00:15:34.190
But what if that's exactly their civilization?

00:15:34.270 --> 00:15:36.230
What if by spreading out across the universe,

00:15:36.320 --> 00:15:38.730
they've developed ultra-high-level
telepathy abilities

00:15:38.820 --> 00:15:43.110
that enable them to confirm
each other's intentions?

00:15:43.200 --> 00:15:44.490
No way...

00:15:44.570 --> 00:15:46.910
Now that we've rushed into the empty nest,

00:15:46.990 --> 00:15:50.290
they'll start attacking
us from every which way!

00:15:53.170 --> 00:15:59.840
After all, only a very few of the Tribe of Iron
possess the ability to leave the starway...

00:15:59.920 --> 00:16:04.090
No, it may be only one.

00:16:04.180 --> 00:16:07.430
What if the Tribe of Gold
gave the Tribe of Iron

00:16:07.510 --> 00:16:12.850
the fifth Nodos to protect the one?

00:16:15.150 --> 00:16:21.030
Did the Tribe of Gold intend to
make the one discover their power?

00:16:22.990 --> 00:16:28.240
Prome O, that thought is meaningless.

00:16:28.330 --> 00:16:33.750
The Tribe of Iron will not
discover the Tribe of Gold's power.

00:16:33.830 --> 00:16:35.830
They will perish.

00:16:38.960 --> 00:16:40.040
What is this?

00:16:40.130 --> 00:16:41.960
What's the matter?

00:16:42.050 --> 00:16:45.340
They're looking for us.

00:16:45.430 --> 00:16:47.050
What?

00:16:49.850 --> 00:16:54.140
You want to try to contact
the Tribe of Silver, Princess?

00:16:54.230 --> 00:16:58.810
I will ask them about themselves directly.

00:16:58.900 --> 00:17:04.150
B-But if the enemy possesses the telepathy
abilities just like we speculated,

00:17:04.240 --> 00:17:07.700
they will find our presence instantly.

00:17:07.780 --> 00:17:11.990
However, there's no other way to avoid crisis.

00:17:14.580 --> 00:17:16.330
Understood.

00:17:16.420 --> 00:17:21.040
We'll leave the terminal planet.
Begin the take-off sequence immediately!

00:17:29.640 --> 00:17:32.510
The spatiotemporal gap has been eliminated.
Entire warping process complete.

00:17:32.600 --> 00:17:37.350
Big Brother, this means that we have
now conquered seven terminal planets.

00:17:37.440 --> 00:17:43.320
This is the least one can expect
from a fleet led by me, Atalantes.

00:17:43.400 --> 00:17:44.610
Now move forward!

00:17:44.690 --> 00:17:47.110
The lowly Tribe of Silver
no longer causes any fear for

00:17:47.200 --> 00:17:48.860
E-Enemy fleets are here!

00:17:48.950 --> 00:17:52.580
Th-That can't be! We've already
conquered the terminal planets!

00:17:52.660 --> 00:17:56.580
They're approaching from direction 272.
They didn't pass though a terminal planet!

00:17:56.660 --> 00:18:00.540
Impossible! Don't tell me
they came through the frontier!

00:18:05.420 --> 00:18:06.710
Go.

00:18:25.440 --> 00:18:27.900
Many enemy fleets are coming
from direction 748, too!

00:18:27.990 --> 00:18:29.820
They're going to block our escape route!

00:18:29.910 --> 00:18:32.780
D-Do something already!

00:18:32.870 --> 00:18:35.910
Change course! Counter the enemy!

00:18:44.500 --> 00:18:47.000
It's from Mobeedo?

00:18:47.090 --> 00:18:49.170
Fleet reorganization?

00:18:49.260 --> 00:18:51.930
Emergency communication
from the fleet in the rear!

00:18:52.010 --> 00:18:54.390
Due to the enemy's arrival,
the key fleets, including the flagship,

00:18:54.470 --> 00:18:56.560
are now engaging in the battle!

00:18:56.640 --> 00:18:59.020
What did you just say?

00:18:59.100 --> 00:19:01.390
From direction 1 96, many objects believed to be

00:19:01.480 --> 00:19:03.650
the enemy's fleets are
approaching at high speed!

00:19:03.730 --> 00:19:08.820
This is insane! Does this mean that the
enemy just arrived at this star system?!

00:19:23.880 --> 00:19:27.000
More enemy fleets have
appeared along our course!

00:19:27.090 --> 00:19:29.380
We should be surrounding them,

00:19:29.460 --> 00:19:33.890
but this looks like we're the ones
who are surrounded by the entire universe!

00:19:33.970 --> 00:19:37.140
Mobeedo must've asked me to reorganize
the fleet because he realized it earlier...

00:19:42.770 --> 00:19:44.190
Found you.

00:19:47.230 --> 00:19:52.820
Why are you the only one
who keeps on following us?

00:19:52.910 --> 00:19:57.490
Were you ordered to do so?

00:19:57.580 --> 00:20:00.700
What about your home?
What about your family?

00:20:02.750 --> 00:20:06.920
What is your affiliation?

00:20:07.000 --> 00:20:08.880
Stop it!

00:20:08.960 --> 00:20:12.840
The Tribe of Iron is talking to us.

00:20:19.430 --> 00:20:22.350
I feel many minds other than yours.

00:20:22.430 --> 00:20:27.150
Do you always share a part
of your psyche with others?

00:20:29.730 --> 00:20:34.820
They will not be the ones to
acquire the Tribe of Gold's power.

00:20:40.580 --> 00:20:42.660
There's no room for you here.

00:20:54.840 --> 00:20:57.720
Why can't I erase my emotions?!

00:21:20.160 --> 00:21:22.120
Begone, Tribe of Iron!

00:21:24.200 --> 00:21:26.330
Let's go, Belcross.

00:21:38.010 --> 00:21:39.430
Nodos!

00:21:39.510 --> 00:21:43.890
It's time for destruction, Tribe of Iron!

00:21:49.230 --> 00:21:52.150
Devour them, Kervius.

00:22:25.220 --> 00:22:33.400
Although I have known you for a long time

00:22:33.480 --> 00:22:40.780
I never dreamed these feelings would sprout

00:22:40.860 --> 00:22:45.910
And I would fall in love with you

00:22:45.990 --> 00:22:56.840
Casually going home,
as I look at the stars in the night sky

00:22:56.920 --> 00:23:09.680
I take the long way on purpose
and lean on your shoulder as we walk

00:23:09.770 --> 00:23:20.900
You tell me you think we can overcome
anything as long as we stay together

00:23:20.990 --> 00:23:26.160
I think as I look into your forthright eyes

00:23:26.240 --> 00:23:32.750
That I love you

00:23:35.460 --> 00:23:39.800
The overwhelming power
of Kervius defeats humankind.

00:23:39.880 --> 00:23:44.430
Next time on Heroic Age,
Episode 20: "The Nodos of Darkness."
